oryteller-screen#post1068959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone have any experience trying to print this out? I have a customizable ST Screen that you can put your own inserts in. I bought the ST Screen from Drivethru but everything is made to print as Portrait orientation, which seems counter productive. Has anyone else used it, as part of a screen to good effect?</div> </div> </div> </div>Customizable ST screen?<br /> <img src=\"http://i3.kym-cdn.com/photos/images/original/001/034/999/1de.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1djeav1YTEwQq1fkDtWEKh7PPVFmzj3y-\" target=\"_blank\">The Repository</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13158-sir-bardiel","name":"Sir Bardiel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13158_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-03T11:22:21-07:00","id":1072624,"title":"","content":"No idea if links to amazon are allowed here, if not someone can remove it. However, it is an ST screen with plastic covering that you can put inserts in, such as:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Savage-Worlds-Customizable-Screen-S2P10002/dp/1930855591/ref=sr_1_2?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1491243658&amp;sr=8-2&amp;keywords=customizable+dm+screen\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Savage-Worlds-Customizable-Screen-S2P10002/dp/1930855591/ref=sr_1_2?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1491243658&amp;sr=8-2&amp;keywords=customizable+dm+screen\" target=\"_blank\"> Amazon.com </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Savage-Worlds-Customizable-Screen-S2P10002/dp/1930855591/ref=sr_1_2?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1491243658&amp;sr=8-2&amp;keywords=customizable+dm+screen\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.amazon.com/Savage-Worlds-Customizable-Screen-S2P10002/dp/1930855591/ref=sr_1_2?ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1491243658&amp;sr=8-2&amp;keywords=customizable+dm+screen </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7550-vulcan7200","name":"Vulcan7200","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-03T17:28:17-07:00","id":1072802,"title":"","content":"That customizable screen is pretty great.<br /> <br /> I personally just printed the three interior pages. I had an old 1st ed Requiem physical screen, so I just used binder clips to hold the top of the pages in place over the text on the screen. The 1st ed screen is actually four panels, so I whipped up a cheat sheet for the Rome debate rules. It's a low tech solution, but it's worked fine. I frequently use the clips and the side of screen facing the players to print relevant art of the NPCs, locations, or other set pieces.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2037-iceix","name":"IceIX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2037_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}